#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:1
msgid "Simulated Annealing for Ising Models"
msgstr "用于 Ising 模型的模拟退火"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:3
msgid ""
"[Why Quantum? Revisiting the Sampling "
"Bottleneck](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md) motivated the need for efficient"
" sampling from Boltzmann distributions. This chapter introduces **simulated "
"annealing (SA)**, the local CPU/GPU-only sampling baseline in KPP, which is "
"also a natural reference point against which [quantum "
"sampling](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md) is compared in the next chapter."
msgstr ""
"[为什么需要量子采样：重温采样瓶颈](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md)说明了高效采样玻尔兹曼分布的必要性。本章介绍**模拟退火（simulated"
" annealing，SA）**——KPP 中仅使用本地 CPU/GPU "
"的采样基线，也是下一章[量子采样](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)的自然参照点。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:5
msgid "The Ising Model at a Glance"
msgstr "Ising 模型一览"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:9
msgid "H(\\mathbf{s}) = -\\sum_i h_i s_i - \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij} s_i s_j."
msgstr "H(\\mathbf{s}) = -\\sum_i h_i s_i - \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij} s_i s_j."

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:16
msgid "P(\\mathbf{s}) = \\frac{1}{Z} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{H(\\mathbf{s})}{T}\\right)."
msgstr "P(\\mathbf{s}) = \\frac{1}{Z} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{H(\\mathbf{s})}{T}\\right)."

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:21
msgid ""
"KPP converts Boltzmann machine parameters into this Ising matrix; the "
"sampler solves it via the Kaiwu SDK `solve()` method."
msgstr "KPP 将玻尔兹曼机参数转换为该 Ising 矩阵；采样器接收该矩阵并由 Kaiwu SDK 的 `solve()` 方法求解。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:23
msgid "The Simulated Annealing Algorithm"
msgstr "模拟退火算法"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:25
msgid ""
"Simulated annealing is a classical metaheuristic inspired by the annealing "
"process in metallurgy. It proceeds in four steps:"
msgstr "模拟退火是一种受冶金退火过程启发的经典元启发式算法，包含四步："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:27
msgid ""
"**Initialization**: start at a high temperature $T_{\\mathrm{high}}$ with a "
"random spin configuration."
msgstr "**初始化**：从高温 $T_{\\mathrm{high}}$ 与随机自旋构型开始。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:28
msgid ""
"**Metropolis updates**: propose single-spin flips $s_i \\to -s_i$; for an "
"energy change $\\Delta E$, accept with probability"
msgstr "**Metropolis 更新**：提出单自旋翻转 $s_i \\to -s_i$；对能量变化 $\\Delta E$，以概率接受"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:30
msgid "P_{\\mathrm{accept}} = \\min\\left(1, \\exp\\left(-\\frac{\\Delta E}{T}\\right)\\right)."
msgstr ""
"P_{\\mathrm{accept}} = \\min\\left(1, \\exp\\left(-\\frac{\\Delta "
"E}{T}\\right)\\right)."

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:35
msgid ""
"**Cooling**: reduce the temperature by a schedule, e.g., geometric cooling "
"$T_{k+1} = \\alpha T_k$ with $0 < \\alpha < 1$."
msgstr "**降温**：按调度降低温度，例如几何降温 $T_{k+1} = \\alpha T_k$（$0 < \\alpha < 1$）。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:36
msgid ""
"**Termination**: stop when the temperature is low; the final configuration "
"approximates a low-energy state."
msgstr "**终止**：当温度足够低时停止；最终构型近似低能状态。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:38
msgid "From Optimization to Sampling"
msgstr "从优化到采样"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:40
msgid ""
"Optimization and Boltzmann sampling have different goals. If the goal is "
"optimization, you keep cooling to find the ground state. If the goal is "
"approximate sampling for generative modeling, two adaptations are needed:"
msgstr "优化与玻尔兹曼采样目标不同。若目标是优化，持续降温以寻找基态；若目标是为生成建模进行近似采样，则需要两项调整："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:42
msgid ""
"**Stop at a finite effective temperature** $T_{\\mathrm{eff}}$ instead of "
"cooling to zero."
msgstr "**在有限有效温度** $T_{\\mathrm{eff}}$ **处停止**，而非冷却到零。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:43
msgid ""
"**Collect multiple samples** from independent annealing runs (or from a "
"single run after thermalization at $T_{\\mathrm{eff}}$)."
msgstr "**收集多个样本**：来自独立的退火运行（或单次运行在 $T_{\\mathrm{eff}}$ 热化后）。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:45
msgid ""
"When implemented carefully, the distribution of the collected samples "
"approximates:"
msgstr "若实现得当，收集到的样本分布近似："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:47
msgid ""
"P(\\mathbf{s}) \\propto "
"\\exp\\left(-\\frac{H(\\mathbf{s})}{T_{\\mathrm{eff}}}\\right),"
msgstr ""
"P(\\mathbf{s}) \\propto "
"\\exp\\left(-\\frac{H(\\mathbf{s})}{T_{\\mathrm{eff}}}\\right),"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:52
msgid ""
"which is precisely the Boltzmann distribution needed for training (Eq. "
"{eq}`eq-boltzmann-prob`). The end-of-annealing configuration must not be "
"treated automatically as an unbiased Boltzmann sample: the temperature, "
"schedule, number of independent runs, and sample correlation all need to be "
"considered."
msgstr ""
"这正是训练所需的玻尔兹曼分布（式 {eq}`eq-boltzmann-"
"prob`）。退火终点的构型不能自动视为无偏玻尔兹曼样本：温度、调度、独立运行次数与样本相关性都需纳入考量。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:54
msgid "Using SA in KPP"
msgstr "在 KPP 中使用 SA"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:56
msgid ""
"The [Quick Start](../quickstart.md) example already trains an RBM with "
"`SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer`. `sample()` constructs the Ising matrix and "
"calls the optimizer; you only pass the sampler to the model:"
msgstr ""
"[快速开始](../quickstart.md)示例已经用 `SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer` 训练 "
"RBM。`sample()` 构造 Ising 矩阵并调用优化器；你只需把采样器传给模型："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:68
msgid ""
"Here, `samples` is the state tensor returned by the model; KPP calls "
"`sampler.solve(ising_mat)` internally, rather than "
"`sampler.sample(hamiltonian)`."
msgstr ""
"此处 `samples` 是模型返回的状态张量；KPP 在内部调用 `sampler.solve(ising_mat)`，而不是 "
"`sampler.sample(hamiltonian)`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:70
msgid "Relationship to Quantum Sampling"
msgstr "与量子采样的关系"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:72
msgid ""
"SA is a suitable starting point for local development, debugging, and "
"baseline experiments. Real quantum hardware, i.e., the CIM, requires "
"credentials, task queueing, and quota; whether it provides a benefit must be"
" evaluated on the specific model, sample-quality metrics, and end-to-end "
"latency. See the side-by-side comparison in [Integrating Quantum Samplers "
"into PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md) in the next chapter."
msgstr ""
"SA 是本地开发、调试和基线实验的合适起点。CIM "
"真机采样需要凭据、任务排队和配额；是否带来收益需要针对具体模型、样本质量指标和端到端耗时进行实验比较。参见下一章[将量子采样器集成到 "
"PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)中的并排对比。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:74
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "小结"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:76
msgid ""
"SA explores the Ising energy landscape via Metropolis updates and a cooling "
"schedule."
msgstr "SA 通过 Metropolis 更新和温度调度探索 Ising 能量景观。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:77
msgid ""
"Optimization and Boltzmann sampling have different goals; finite-temperature"
" settings and sample evaluation are essential."
msgstr "优化与玻尔兹曼采样的目标不同；有限温度设置与样本评估不可省略。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:78
msgid "SA is used through `rbm.sample(sampler)` like any other optimizer."
msgstr "在 KPP 中，SA 与其他优化器一样通过 `rbm.sample(sampler)` 使用。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:79
msgid ""
"The trade-offs between SA and quantum sampling: thermal activation vs. "
"tunneling, local vs. cloud, latency, are compared in the [next "
"chapter](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)."
msgstr ""
"SA 与量子采样的权衡: 热激活 vs. 隧穿、本地 vs. 云端、延迟, "
"将在[下一章](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)中进行比较。"

